class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">p₁</span> <span class=\"fn\">p₂</span> <span class=\"fn\">p₃</span> <span class=\"fn\">t</span> <span class=\"fn\">g</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> →\n  <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">d</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Dvd.dvd\">∣</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly.denote'\">Poly.denote'</a> <span class=\"fn\">ctx</span> <span class=\"fn\">p₁</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly.denote'\">Poly.denote'</a> <span class=\"fn\">ctx</span> <span class=\"fn\">p₂</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly.denote'\">Poly.denote'</a> <span class=\"fn\">ctx</span> <span class=\"fn\">p₃</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Given `d ∣ p₁` and `p₂ ≤ 0`, if `p₂ ≡ c (mod g)` for a divisor `g` of `d` (witnessed by\n`p₂ - t*p₁` having variable coefficients divisible by `g`), then `p₂` is at most the largest\nvalue `≤ 0` congruent to `c` modulo `g`. Generalizes `dvd_le_tight`, which is the case `t = ±1`,\n`g = d`, `p₂ - t*p₁` constant.","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.dvd_le_tight_mod","kind":"theorem","line":2148,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.dvd_le_tight_mod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L2148-L2172"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.dvd_le_tight_mod_cert\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">dvd_le_tight_mod_cert</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">p₂ </span><span class=\"fn\">p₃</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly\">Poly</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t </span><span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Certificate for `dvd_le_tight_mod`: `g` is a positive divisor of `d`, `p₂ - t*p₁` has all its\nvariable coefficients divisible by `g`, and `p₃` is `p₂` with its constant increased by the\ndistance from `p₂ - t*p₁` to the next multiple of `g` below it.","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.dvd_le_tight_mod_cert","kind":"def","line":2137,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.dvd_le_tight_mod_cert","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L2137-L2146"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.emod_le\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">emod_le</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.emod_le_cert\">emod_le_cert</a> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a> → <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.emod_le","kind":"theorem","line":2122,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.emod_le","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L2122-L2127"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.emod_le_cert\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">emod_le_cert</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.emod_le_cert","kind":"def","line":2118,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.emod_le_cert","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L2118-L2120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.emod_nonneg\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span c