class=\"fn\">b</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#GT.gt\">&gt;</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Neg.neg\">-</a><span class=\"fn\">b</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cmod_gt_of_pos","kind":"theorem","line":346,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.cmod_gt_of_pos","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L346-L347"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cdiv_add_cmod\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">cdiv_add_cmod</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cdiv\">cdiv</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cmod\">cmod</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cdiv_add_cmod","kind":"theorem","line":338,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.cdiv_add_cmod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L338-L344"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cmod\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">cmod</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the ceiling-compatible remainder of the division `a / b`.\nThis function ensures that the remainder is consistent with `cdiv`, meaning:\n```\na = b * cdiv a b + cmod a b\n```\nSee theorem `cdiv_add_cmod`. We also have\n```\n-b < cmod a b ≤ 0\n```","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cmod","kind":"def","line":323,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.cmod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L323-L336"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cdiv\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">cdiv</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the ceiling of the division `a / b`. That is, the result is equivalent to `⌈a / b⌉`.\nExamples:\n- `cdiv 7 3` returns `3`\n- `cdiv (-7) 3` returns `-2`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.cdiv","kind":"def","line":313,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.cdiv","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L313-L321"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Expr.norm_k_eq_norm\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">Expr</span>.<span class=\"name\">norm_k_eq_norm</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">e</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Expr.norm_k\">norm_k</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">e</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Expr.norm\">norm</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Expr.norm_k_eq_norm","kind":"theorem","line":310,"name":"Int.Internal.Linear.Expr.norm_k_eq_norm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Int/Linear.lean#L310-L311"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Expr.norm_k\"><span class=\"name\">Int</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linear</span>.<span class=\"name\">Expr</span>.<span class=\"name\">norm_k</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./In